Spec: Independent Android native stream consumer

Purpose:
  Verify public SDK integration from a separately signed application and actual distinct Android UID.

Owns:
  ./build.gradle
  ./src/main/AndroidManifest.xml

Structure:
  ./src: SDK-only application and native instrumentation acceptance.

Must:
  Depend only on the public stream SDK; carry no Agent classes, device keys, database or transport implementation.
  Require an explicit fixture signing keystore, never inherit the Agent debug signer.
  Keep owner approval and remote grant administration outside the consumer.
